
# Repeato creates backups of your workspace database.rpt file every now and then. It can be excluded from your repo
backup
# Repeato creates screenshots directory for storing screenshots. It can be excluded from your repo
screenshots
# When you open a test for editing, Repeato creates a working copy of the test directory. There is no use of versioning or syncing that copy. So we execlude it
*.workingcopy
# Exclude .localConfig.json file, because it is meant to be used per workstation / folder and not per user or repo:
.localConfig.json
